# LOOM-8 demo: 90s jungle / drum and bass, 170 BPM, A minor. (tools/demos/render.sh renders it; its bank, the amen
# and think breaks, is build/demos/jungle.bin: private, never committed.)
#   T1 slice "chop": the amen, one bar in 16 slices, mono, crushed a little (a sampler's twelve bits); re-cut per
#      section, rolls by multiply, its pitch turned up by hand through the build
#   T2 stack "rope sub": the sub          T3 brocade "chenille" as the reese: seven saws, legato, the filter on an LFO
#   T4 voile "voile choir": the pad       T5 stack "braid stab": dub stabs into the delay
#   T6 slice "chop": the think break      T7 weft "thread lead" as a dub siren (a square LFO on the pitch)
# Song: intro 8 bars (the amen through a closed filter, opened by hand), build 4, drop A 8 (a stutter throw at
# its end), the change 4 (the think break, the sub alone, stabs), drop B 8, outro 4 (echo throw, then stop).
master 4096
samples build/demos/jungle.bin
bpm 170

# ---- the sounds (90s jungle: the breaks do the work. The amen sped up and pitched up, a little sampler grit on it
# (twelve bits or so: an S950's), the think under it; a deep sine sub alone in the lows; the reese on top, its
# filter swept slowly; dub stabs and a siren into a long dotted echo; a dark hall for the pads; the master medium
# dark, the breaks crisp)
# T1 the amen: one bar in 16 slices, mono; driven a little and crushed a little (bits, not rate), the hall a touch
knob 1 engine slice
preset 1 chop slice
knob 1 e1 u1
knob 1 e4 127
knob 1 cut 127
knob 1 ctype crush
knob 1 camt 34
knob 1 ctone 110
knob 1 cmix 100
knob 1 brain no
knob 1 level 107
knob 1 send2 10
# T2 stack "rope sub": the sub, alone below 100 Hz
preset 2 rope_sub stack
# (the song was written before a bass preset sat an octave down)
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 brain no
knob 2 level 94
# T3 brocade "chenille" as the reese: seven saws, legato, the low-pass at 1 kHz moved by a slow LFO, resonant
preset 3 chenille brocade
knob 3 brain no
knob 3 e2 40
knob 3 e4 84
knob 3 vmode legato
knob 3 porta 40
knob 3 cut 58
knob 3 res 44
knob 3 fenv 76
knob 3 ltype wave
knob 3 lspeed 2
knob 3 lamt 92
knob 3 ldest filter
knob 3 lx 0
knob 3 lx2 sine
knob 3 level 85
# T4 voile "voile choir": the pad, washed in the hall
preset 4 voile_choir voile
knob 4 brain no
knob 4 level 80
knob 4 send2 56
# T5 stack "braid stab": dub stabs into the echo
preset 5 braid_stab stack
knob 5 brain no
knob 5 level 87
knob 5 send1 64
knob 5 send2 22
# T6 the think break, under the amen
knob 6 engine slice
preset 6 chop slice
knob 6 e1 u2
knob 6 e4 127
knob 6 ctone 127
knob 6 brain no
knob 6 level 103
# T7 weft "thread lead" as a dub siren into the echo
preset 7 thread_lead weft
knob 7 brain no
knob 7 ltype wave
knob 7 lspeed 4
knob 7 lamt 84
knob 7 ldest voice
knob 7 lx 1
knob 7 lx2 square
knob 7 level 81
knob 7 send1 80
knob 7 send2 34
# FX I a dotted-eighth echo with long repeats, dubby (dark repeats); FX II a hall
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 80
knob 11 e3 84
knob 11 e4 50
knob 12 engine hall
knob 12 e2 70
# the master: the grit is on the amen; the low end held, the top lifted a little for the breaks
mst hi 76
mst lo 62
mst comp 56
mst level 90

