# ---- T7 the siren: a long E5 every 2 bars in the intro; in drop B a short call every 4
pat 7 1 32
notes 7 1 1 6 90 E5
notes 7 1 17 4 80 A5
chance 7 1 17 1:2
pat 7 2 64
notes 7 2 1 3 90 A5
notes 7 2 33 3 90 E5

# ---- scenes (patterns for T1..T8, COND, THROW) and their mutes
scenedef 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 1 .xx.xx.x
scenedef 2 4 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 2 .xx.xx.x
scenedef 3 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 3 ...x.xxx
scenedef 4 1 2 1 1 2 2 1 1
scenemute 4 x.x....x
scenedef 5 3 1 2 1 1 3 2 1
scenemute 5 ...x...x
scenedef 6 1 2 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 6 .xx.xx.x
song 1:8 2:4 3:8 4:4 5:8 6:4
songloop 0

# ---- play the song (HOME, SELECT to the Song page, PLAY) and perform: the intro's filter by hand, the throws
knob 1 cut 50
knob 4 cut 70
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
stats reset
wav loom_demo_jungle.wav
tap PLAY
bars 2
knob 1 cut 62
bars 2
knob 1 cut 74
bars 2
knob 1 cut 88
bars 1
knob 1 cut 100
bars 1
knob 1 cut 127
knob 4 cut 90
# the build (4 bars): the pad opens; the slices' pitch turned up over the last two bars, back for the drop
bars 2
knob 1 e3 66
bars 0.5
knob 1 e3 68
bars 0.5
knob 1 e3 70
knob 4 cut 110
bars 0.5
knob 1 e3 72
bars 0.25
knob 1 e3 75
bars 0.1875
knob 1 e3 64
bars 0.0625
# drop A, 8 bars; a stutter on everything for the last half bar
bars 7.5
throw stutter on mel
bars 0.5
throw stutter off mel
# the change, 4 bars: the stabs' delay longer
knob 11 e3 100
bars 4
knob 11 e3 84
# drop B, 8 bars, the think quieter under the amen; a repeat on the drums' last beat
knob 6 level 100
knob 6 cut 90
bars 7.75
throw repeat on mel 1
bars 0.25
throw repeat off mel 1
# outro, 4 bars: echo out on the last bar
knob 1 cut 80
bars 3
throw echo on mel
bars 1
throw echo off mel
wait 3000
wavstop
stats
